## -- a willow's cry

*2016 · Mingji Liu*

Alone and my,  
the sky  
and sky and sky.

-- grass seeds fly -- a willow's cry

-- without knowing why  
-- recalling her eyes.

Even poplars sigh of  
sky and  
sky and sky  
and sky and sky.

Yes.

I think I'm ready to say goodbye,

or so, I lie.

## An existential necklace.

*2016 · Mingji Liu*

Bead it through,  
Let it break like the bread of days.  
Bead made of pen twirls,

The hunger of cured ham,  
Taste of whiskey, crimson dress hot,

This whiskey tastes as hot as a  
Crimson dress. Tight fit,  
Wolf-lolling. Gap toothed, beaked whale,  
God. Where am I now.

