## Florence

*2016 · Mingji Liu*

Final night in Florence. We are sitting on the cold, dark slopes outside the Palazzo Pitti. The streets are largely empty and only a spotful of stars peer through the night sky of Tuscany. I tell her that the cobblestones feel tired and pensive. She offers me another cigarette as we talk into the night.

Florence is surely the most beautiful place on Earth.

This is the happiest I have felt in a long time.

