some may wait, or pray for a *force majeuer*,  
some only dream a city completer,  
but urban blight, we must seek to treat her.  
so let us rise up, wage poverty war!  
strike the ghettos, like needle to a hem!  
break beggars like mosaics! shoot-to-kill!  
of the lower classes, none will survive...  
WE WILL EAT THEM ALIVE, WE WILL EAT THEM  
ALIVE, WE WILL EAT THEM ALIVE, WE WILL  
EAT THEM ALIVE, WE WILL EAT THEM ALIVE.

